# Assistant content: a fenced code block. internal/tui/markdown.go's
# CodeBlock style indents the body two spaces and leaves body text in the
# terminal's own colour (chroma only lights up recognised tokens).
@faux testdata/faux/qa/content-code.yaml
@size 120x40

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
SHOT welcome
TYPE explain the change
KEY enter
WAITFOR /function limited/ 20
SHOT reply
EXPECT /function limited\(count\)/
EXPECT /return count > 10;/
EXPECT_NOT /```/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
